# Scratch space for the differential harness and the build script:
#
#   .artifacts/build/    `scripts/build-wasm.mjs` stages a release build here
#                        before vendoring it, and the harness re-runs that script
#                        to prove the shipped artifact is still what this tree
#                        compiles to.
#   .artifacts/shipped/  the vendored glue, mirrored so node will parse it as ESM.
#                        The .wasm is never copied — the shipped bytes go straight
#                        into initSync().
#
# All of it is reproducible in one command, and the artifact that MATTERS is
# committed where it is served from: Stredio-Web/public/assets/groloo-core/.
# A second, staler copy here is exactly the thing this phase is removing.
.artifacts/
